    <preface>
      <p>Labor 2013-14 Budget Savings (Measures No. 1) Act 2015</p>
      <p>No. 72, 2015</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to taxation, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
